Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(examples): rebuild cone-thread NC for the turning
 ride spacing

The catalog case turning/cone-thread reached main after this branch
was cut. Rebuild it with cargo xtask catalog. The NC drops 465 repeated
G01 blocks and adds none. The README drops the #2882 limit line.

Refs #2882

